        "headline": "Transactions mail received per household: published values for FY2023 and how they moved.",
        "statements": [
          {
            "text": "In FY2023, Transactions mail received per household was 114.4 (pieces per household per year). That was unchanged from the previous year, FY2022. That fell by 31.2 (21.4%) from five years earlier, FY2018.",
